# Keep the build context small and never ship local state / secrets.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/build
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo

.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Never copy real env files into the image (the template is fine to keep out too).
**/.env
**/.env.*

**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/npm-debug.log*

# Docs / editor
**/.vscode
**/.idea
README.md
